{"book":"dc","num":134,"verses":[{"en":"We believe that governments were instituted of God for the benefit of man; and that he holds men accountable for their acts in relation to them, both in making laws and administering them, for the good and safety of society.","n":1,"sm":"Matou te talitonu sa faatutuina e le Atua malo mo le lelei o tagata; ma ua tuu e ia e tali tagata mo a latou mea e fai e faatatau i malo, i le faia o tulafono ma lo latou faatinoga, mo le lelei ma le saogalemu o tagata.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"we believe","sm":"talitonu"},{"en":"","sm":"sa"},{"en":"","sm":"faatutuina"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"God,","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"governments","sm":"malo"},{"en":"for","sm":"mo"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the good","sm":"lelei"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of men","sm":"tagata;"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"tuu"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"he","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tali"},{"en":"men","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"for","sm":"mo"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"·","sm":"latou"},{"en":"their good;","sm":"mea"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"to acts","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faatatau"},{"en":"to","sm":"i"},{"en":"governments","sm":"malo,"},{"en":"to","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"making","sm":"faia"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"laws","sm":"tulafono"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"lo"},{"en":"and their","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"faatinoga,"},{"en":"for","sm":"mo"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the good","sm":"lelei"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"safety","sm":"saogalemu"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of men","sm":"tagata."}]},{"en":"We believe that no government can exist in peace, except such laws are framed and held inviolate as will secure to each individual the free exercise of conscience, the right and control of property, and the protection of life.","n":2,"sm":"Matou te talitonu e leai se malo e mafai ona ola i