 God; and that men are amenable to him, and to him only, for the exercise of it, unless their religious opinions prompt them to infringe upon the rights and liberties of others; but we do not believe that human law has a right to interfere in prescribing rules of worship to bind the consciences of men, nor dictate forms for public or private devotion; that the civil magistrate should restrain crime, but never control conscience; should punish guilt, but never suppress the freedom of the soul.","n":4,"sm":"Matou te talitonu na faatutuina e le Atua mea tau lotu; ma e tali atu tagata ia te ia, ma na’o ia lava, mo lona faaaogaina, vagana ai ua uunaia i latou e o latou manatu faalelotu e faalavelave i aiā ma saolotoga o isi; ae ua matou lē talitonu ua i ai i tulafono faaletagata se aiā e faalavelave ai i le faia o tulafono faaletapuaiga e saisaitia ai le lotofuatiaifo o tagata, pe faatonu ai ala e fai ai tapuaiga faitele pe faaletagata lava ia; ma e faapea e tatau i le taitai faalemalo ona taofi le solitulafono, ae lē pulea le lotofuatiaifo; e tatau ona faasala le tausalaina, ae lē taofia le saolotoga o le agaga.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"we believe","sm":"talitonu"},{"en":"that","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"faatutuina"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"God,","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"for","sm":"mea"},{"en":"only","sm":"tau"},{"en":"","sm":"lotu;"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tali"},{"en":"to","sm":"atu"},{"en":"men","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"to him","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"only","sm":"na’o"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"in him","sm":"lava,"},{"en":"for","sm":"mo"},{"en":"his","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"faaaogaina,"},{"en":"·","sm":"vagana"},{"en":"·","sm":"ai"},{"en":"unless","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"uunaia"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"them","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"their","sm":"latou"},{"en":"opinions","sm":"manatu"},{