":"saolotoga"},{"en":"of","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"conscience.","sm":"mafaufau"},{"en":"","sm":"fetalai."}]},{"en":"We believe that every man should be honored in his station, rulers and magistrates as such, being placed for the protection of the innocent and the punishment of the guilty; and that to the laws all men owe respect and deference, as without them peace and harmony would be supplanted by anarchy and terror; human laws being instituted for the express purpose of regulating our interests as individuals and nations, between man and man; and divine laws given of heaven, prescribing rules on spiritual concerns, for faith and worship, both to be answered by man to his Maker.","n":6,"sm":"Matou te talitonu e tatau ona faamamaluina tagata uma taitoatasi i lona lava tulaga, e pei o pule ma faipule, ua faatutuina mo le puipuiga o e ua lē sala ma le faasalaina o e ua sala; ma e faapea e tatau i tagata uma ona ava ma faaaloalo i tulafono, aua a aunoa ma ia tulafono o le a suia le filemu ma le lotogatasi i le pule faamalosi ma le mata’u; ona ua faatutuina tulafono faaletagata mo le faamoemoe tonu o le faafoeina o o tatou faamoemoega o ni tagata taitoatasi ma atunuu, i le va o le tagata ma le tagata; ma ua tuu mai tulafono paia mai le lagi, ua tuu mai ai tulafono e faatatau i atugaluga faaleagaga, mo le faatuatua ma le tapua’i, o ni mea uma e tali atu ai le tagata i Lē na faia o ia.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"we believe","sm":"talitonu"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"tatau"},{"en":"should","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"faamamaluina"},{"en":"·","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"·","sm":"uma"},{"en":"every man,","sm":"taitoatasi"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"in his","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"that","sm":"tulaga,"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"as","sm":"pei"},{"en":"of","sm":"o"},{"en":"rules","sm":"pule"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"faipule,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faatutuina"},{"en":"for","sm":"mo"},